    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]SECTOR ENFORCEMENT CENTER - FORT THUNDER, TRAPPIST-5[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Engagement Protocol - Shivas Snowball AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-SE"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"Weston-Yamada's research installation has gone dark in the middle of one of the coldest and most desolate planets in the Drift."}

    {"The nature of their research remains classified, but the loss of all contact, including with internal security personnel, is cause for immediate concern."}

    {"You are authorized to enter and secure by force."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish a fortified FOB with clear fields of fire toward excavation sites."}
    {"[bullet]Eliminate threats and reestablish control over both surface and subsurface structures."}
    {"[bullet]Seize R&D vaults, armories, and power junctions before sabotage or data wipes occur."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Destroy Weston-Yamada field labs that cannot be secured."}
    {"[bullet]Monitor for biohazard vectors or contamination reports."}
    {"[bullet]Ensure no survivors escape without full debrief and inspection."}

    {"[underline]Do not trust anyone on-site.[/underline]"}
    {"If the company called it a “weather station,” it's probably a lab."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Colonel Margaret A.W. Shanks[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]United Nations Marine Corps | Colonial Protection Organization - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]No mercy. No doubt.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
