    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]PROVOST MARSHAL'S FIELD OFFICE - NEW MASON COLONY, 61 CYGNI SYSTEM[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Deployment Priorities - Shivas Snowball AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-HM"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"Shiva-1 is a small Weston-Yamada research station on a frozen, isolated world."}

    {"It was self-sustaining and, until recently, entirely peaceful."}

    {"Its sudden silence raises concerns about equipment failure, medical emergencies, or environmental catastrophe."}

    {"[underline]You are being sent not as occupiers, but as investigators.[/underline]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Deploy a Forward Operating Base on site, avoiding damage to entry tunnels or habitat domes."}
    {"[bullet]Find and evacuate all surviving scientists, engineers, or maintenance crews."}
    {"[bullet]Protect research archives from weather damage or corporate erasure."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Ensure heating and oxygenation in residential quarters are restored."}
    {"[bullet]Handle unarmed personnel with non-lethal methods. Prioritize diplomacy."}
    {"[bullet]Scan and report suspicious excavation zones without destroying them."}

    {"Every scientist down there had a family, a purpose, and a life worth saving."}
    {"Don't forget that."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Colonel Adrian Blackburn[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]UNMC Provost Marshal | Hearts & Minds Movement - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]In service to justice and peace.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
