    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]TECHNICAL OPERATIONS DIRECTORATE - ANVIL STATION, HERCULINA ORBIT[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Research-Oriented Objectives - Shivas Snowball AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-RI"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"Shiva-1 was an experimental cold-zone lab with excavation capabilities."}

    {"Most of its sensor output was classified or suppressed by Weston-Yamada internal channels."}

    {"We believe the blackout may relate to something unearthed beneath the ice, and we need to find out what."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Secure a FOB with direct access to sub-zero labs and excavation boreholes."}
    {"[bullet]Recover cryogenic samples, dig logs, and deep-ice anomaly readings."}
    {"[bullet]Retrieve all preserved biological material. Priority is to be given to frozen or dormant forms."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Scan any abnormal growths near glacial walls or thermal anomalies."}
    {"[bullet]Recover excavation drones or control interfaces for analysis."}
    {"[bullet]Document sudden heating or thawing patterns in permafrost tunnels."}

    {"You may be standing atop an incredibly old and well preserved Xenoform."}

    {"[underline]Don't miss it.[/underline]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Lt. Colonel Geoffrey Lamdem[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]Division Logistics Commander | Military Organization for Development and Innovation - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]Onward through progress.[/italic][/color]"}

